  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1110742.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(26 fotos) Ta&amp;Ter durant tot l&#39;estiu a la barra de les piscines de Suera,</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/IMG_3217.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">i The Palas Bar, que ha reobert aquest divendres les portes, regentat per la filla i el gendre jove del primer propietari, animen el dies i les nits a Suera, que divendres 31 de juliol iniciar&agrave; la Setmana Cultural, i divendres 7 d&#39;agost, les festes d&#39;estiu.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110736.jpg\" alt=\"p1110736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110737.jpg\" alt=\"p1110737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110739.jpg\" alt=\"p1110739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110740.jpg\" alt=\"p1110740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110742.jpg\" alt=\"p1110742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/p1110744.jpg\" alt=\"p1110744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/taampteribarpalassuera/img_3201.jpg\" alt=\"img_3201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e